<view class="wrap"><view class="header"><text class="brand">UKGoose</text><text class="tag">MANCHESTER PILOT</text></view><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP BETWEEN CHAPTERS</text><text class="headline">New city.\nLess baggage.</text><text class="italic">More possibility.</text><image class="goose" src="/assets/goose.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="sub">Collection → a little pause → a new home</text></view><view class="notice">Local demo · team model estimates · no real payments</view><view class="card"><text class="section">01 / Plan the in-between</text><text class="label">Item name</text><input value="{{form.title}}" data-key="title" bindinput="field"/><text class="label">Category</text><picker range="{{categories}}" data-key="category" bindchange="field">{{form.category}} ⌄</picker><view class="row"><view><text class="label">Item value · £</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.value}}" data-key="value" bindinput="field"/></view><view><text class="label">Parcels / lots · 1–4</text><input type="number" value="{{form.units}}" data-key="units" bindinput="field"/></view></view><text class="label">Collection</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.pickup}}" data-key="pickup" bindchange="field">{{form.pickup}} ⌄</picker><text class="label">Delivery</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.delivery}}" data-key="delivery" bindchange="field">{{form.delivery}} ⌄</picker><view class="switch"><text>Buyer already confirmed?</text><switch color="#d7af16" checked="{{form.matched}}" data-key="matched" bindchange="field"/></view><text class="label">Forecast month for storage allocation</text><picker range="{{monthLabels}}" value="{{form.forecastMonth - 1}}" data-key="forecastMonth" bindchange="field">{{monthLabels[form.forecastMonth - 1]}} ⌄</picker><text class="fine">Team model estimate; one lot = one parcel. Weighted carrier benchmark, not a live quote.</text><button bindtap="check" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">Check my plan →</button></view><view wx:if="{{quote}}" class="card estimate"><text class="section">02 / Your transparent estimate</text><text class="price">£{{quote.total}}</text><text>{{quote.days}} storage days · {{quote.units}} unit(s)</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="key"><text>{{item.key}}</text><text>£{{item.value}}</text></view><text class="note">{{quote.reason}}</text><text class="fine">Buyer pays collection, storage and delivery. Seller pays commission separately. Seller net proceeds: £{{quote.sellerProceeds}}. Item value is separate.</text><text class="fine">Buyer payment including goods: £{{quote.buyerPayment}}. Separate seller fee: £{{quote.sellerPayment}}. Seller payout: £{{quote.sellerPayout}}.</text><text class="fine">{{quote.financial.label}} · {{quote.financial.forecastOrders}} forecast orders · {{quote.financial.pallets}} pallets.</text><text class="fine">{{quote.billing}}</text><text class="fine">{{quote.settlement}}</text><button bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">Request this plan ↗</button></view><view class="section">Your things. Their journey.</view><view class="switch"><text class="fine">Demo role: {{role}} · not campus verified</text><button size="mini" bindtap="switchRole">Switch role</button></view><button bindtap="refresh">Refresh journeys ↻</button><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="card fine">No requests yet. Create your first plan above.</view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="order" class="card"><text class="tag">{{order.id}} / {{order.status}}</text><text class="order-title">{{order.input.title}}</text><text class="fine">{{order.input.pickup}} → {{order.input.delivery}}</text><text class="fine">Settlement: {{order.settlement}}</text><view wx:for="{{order.events}}" wx:for-item="event" wx:key="at" class="event"><text>{{event.status}}</text><text class="fine">{{event.at}}</text><text class="fine">{{event.note}}</text></view><button wx:for="{{order.actions}}" wx:for-item="target" wx:key="*this" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-target="{{target}}" bindtap="action">{{target}} →</button><button wx:if="{{order.canSettle}}" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-target="settle" bindtap="action">Record simulated settlement</button></view><text class="footer">STUDENT LIFE, LIGHTER. / UKGOOSE</text></view>